B = [
('McDonalds','North America','1970s-present','restaurant','In the style of McDonalds, bright, fast, family-friendly and instantly legible. A saturated red and sunny golden yellow pair carries everything, in broad flat fields with crisp white as breathing room. A rounded double-arch letter shape in yellow recurs as the central mark, often alone and oversized. Forms are friendly, rounded and modular, in glossy moulded plastic, kraft-brown paper and card, and simple printed wraps. Newer graphics use playful flat illustration, bold dots, wavy lines and cut-out food shapes on red or yellow backgrounds. Lettering is soft, chunky, rounded sans-serif in white or yellow. Photography is bright, overhead, evenly lit and cheerful, with hands, steam and tidy, repeated arrangements.'),
('Braun','Europe','1950s-70s','electronics','In the style of Braun, calm, rational, ornament-free functional design. Simple geometric volumes with softly rounded corners, tight even gaps and precise tolerances. Matte or satin surfaces in off-white, pale grey, black and graphite, with natural light wood or clear translucent material used sparingly. Small round or flush details sit neatly grouped on a strict grid, with one tiny accent of orange, yellow, green or red marking the one thing that matters. Lettering is a compact, even, lowercase-feeling grotesque sans-serif, often as a plain black wordmark on white, and graphics use bold primary colour bars and rigorous grids. Fine regular perforations add texture. Photography is sparse, neutral and quietly lit, honest and understated.'),
('Nintendo','East Asia','1980s-present','toys','In the style of Nintendo, playful, approachable, toy-like yet neatly built. Compact rounded rectangles with chunky friendly proportions in glossy and matte plastic. Palette is bold signature red with white, light grey and black, plus bright primary or pastel accents in blue, yellow and green arranged in tidy symmetrical layouts. Packaging is clean and confident, with big flat colour fields, a white rounded-rectangle logo on red, and cheerful illustrated characters in thick outlines. Cross shapes and small round coloured discs recur as motifs. Rounded, slightly wide sans-serif lettering, often in red or white. Photography is bright, high-key and clean on white, showing friendly play, smiles and cosy family warmth.'),
('Rolex','Europe','1950s-present','watches','In the style of Rolex, solid, imposing, polished, status-heavy Swiss luxury. Robust round forms in polished and brushed stainless steel or warm yellow gold, with fluted edges, satin and mirror finishes side by side and a tiny five-pointed crown motif as the recurring emblem. Deep forest green is the signature colour, paired with gold, white, black, blue and cream. Lettering is crisp, upright serif capitals in gold or white, widely spaced. Packaging and graphics use rich green leather-grain, embossed gold crests and heavy lacquered boxes. Photography is dark, dramatic and glossy, with sharp highlights on metal, black backdrops, ocean, peak and expedition settings, and an air of earned prestige.'),
('Harley-Davidson','North America','1940s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Harley-Davidson, rumbling, rebellious open-road Americana. Heavy forms with a low, long silhouette, deep chrome plating and fat teardrop volumes in gloss black with a strong orange accent. A bar-and-shield badge shape recurs, framed by winged eagle, skull and flame graphics, tattoo-style flourishes and pinstripe scrolls. Palette is black, burnt orange, chrome silver, white and distressed grey, often in colour-blocked panels and camouflage-like splatter. Materials are fringed and riveted black leather, worn denim and cast metal. Lettering is bold, slanted, vintage script and heavy block capitals, often weathered. Photography is gritty, grainy, high-contrast and monochrome, with sunsets, asphalt and swaggering independence.'),
]
